#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Monitor a job {#monitor-a-job}"
msgstr "Pantau job {#monitor-a-job}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use these methods to check the status of your submitted jobs, retrieve results, and view details related to the job and its execution.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan metode berikut untuk memeriksa status job yang kamu kirimkan, mengambil hasil, dan melihat detail terkait job serta eksekusinya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit\" label=\"Monitor a job with Qiskit\">\n"
"        The job instance provides several methods for monitoring:\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit\" label=\"Pantau job dengan Qiskit\">\n"
"        Instance job menyediakan beberapa metode untuk pemantauan:\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        | Method | Description |\n"
"        | --- | --- |\n"
"        | `job.status()` | Check the current job status |\n"
"        | `job.job_id()` | Get the unique job identifier |\n"
"        | `job.result()` | Retrieve job results (blocking call until complete) |\n"
"        | `job.wait_for_final_state()` | Block until the job reaches a terminal state |\n"
msgstr ""
"        | Method | Description |\n"
"        | --- | --- |\n"
"        | `job.status()` | Check the current job status |\n"
"        | `job.job_id()` | Get the unique job identifier |\n"
"        | `job.result()` | Retrieve job results (blocking call until complete) |\n"
"        | `job.wait_for_final_state()` | Block until the job reaches a terminal state |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP\" label=\"Monitor a job on IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        Navigate to the [Workloads page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads) and check the Status column. Your job status appears as one of the following:\n"
"        - **Pending**: Job is waiting to run on a QPU\n"
"        - **In progress**: Job is currently executing\n"
"        - **Completed**: Job finished successfully\n"
"        - **Failed**: Job encountered an error\n"
"        - **Canceled**: User canceled the job\n"
msgstr ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP\" label=\"Pantau job di IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        Navigasikan ke [halaman Workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads) dan periksa kolom Status. Status jobmu akan muncul sebagai salah satu dari berikut:\n"
"        - **Pending**: Job sedang menunggu untuk dijalankan pada QPU\n"
"        - **In progress**: Job sedang dieksekusi\n"
"        - **Completed**: Job selesai dengan sukses\n"
"        - **Failed**: Job mengalami error\n"
"        - **Canceled**: Pengguna membatalkan job\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "        Click on the job name or row to open the detailed view, where you can see information such as the results and any error messages.\n"
msgstr "        Klik pada nama atau baris job untuk membuka tampilan detail, di mana kamu bisa melihat informasi seperti hasil dan pesan error apa pun.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Why a job stays \"In progress\" {#why-a-job-stays-in-progress}"
msgstr "Mengapa job tetap \"In progress\" {#why-a-job-stays-in-progress}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You might notice that a job (using either job mode or batch mode) you expect to take only a few seconds stays in the **In progress** status (called `RUNNING` in Qiskit) for much longer. This is normal, and it does not mean the job is consuming that entire time as usage. It happens because of how jobs are scheduled onto a QPU:\n"
msgstr "Kamu mungkin memperhatikan bahwa job (menggunakan mode job maupun mode batch) yang kamu perkirakan hanya membutuhkan beberapa detik tetap berada dalam status **In progress** (disebut `RUNNING` di Qiskit) jauh lebih lama. Ini normal, dan tidak berarti job tersebut menggunakan seluruh waktu itu sebagai usage. Hal ini terjadi karena cara job dijadwalkan pada QPU:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Every job requires classical pre-processing before it can run on the QPU. A job moves to **In progress** (`RUNNING`) as soon as this classical processing begins — not when it starts executing on the QPU.\n"
msgstr "Setiap job memerlukan pre-processing klasik sebelum bisa berjalan pada QPU. Job berpindah ke **In progress** (`RUNNING`) segera setelah pemrosesan klasik ini dimulai — bukan saat mulai dieksekusi pada QPU.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Most of this classical processing runs in parallel, so multiple jobs can be **In progress** at the same time.\n"
msgstr "Sebagian besar pemrosesan klasik ini berjalan secara paralel, sehingga beberapa job bisa berada dalam status **In progress** pada saat yang sama.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "However, only one job at a time can run on the QPU. When several jobs finish their classical processing and are ready to execute, they must wait their turn for the QPU. This is known as *QPU contention*. When contention is high, a job can remain **In progress** noticeably longer than the few seconds of QPU time it actually needs.\n"
msgstr "Namun, hanya satu job pada satu waktu yang bisa berjalan pada QPU. Ketika beberapa job selesai dengan pemrosesan klasiknya dan siap untuk dieksekusi, mereka harus menunggu giliran untuk QPU. Ini dikenal sebagai *QPU contention*. Ketika contention tinggi, sebuah job bisa tetap berada dalam status **In progress** lebih lama secara signifikan dibandingkan dengan beberapa detik waktu QPU yang sebenarnya dibutuhkan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Contention can also occur when a system-maintenance task, such as calibration, is running on the QPU. Your job stays **In progress** until the maintenance task completes and the QPU becomes available.\n"
msgstr "Contention juga bisa terjadi ketika tugas pemeliharaan sistem, seperti kalibrasi, sedang berjalan pada QPU. Jobmu tetap berada dalam status **In progress** hingga tugas pemeliharaan selesai dan QPU menjadi tersedia.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Because of this, the elapsed wall-clock time a job spends **In progress** is not the same as its usage. Both the [estimated usage](/guides/estimate-job-run-time) and the [maximum execution time](/guides/max-execution-time) are based only on the time the QPU is locked to execute your job, and therefore exclude the multi-threaded classical processing described above. A long **In progress** time does not increase your reported usage or cost.\n"
msgstr "Karena itu, waktu wall-clock yang berlalu saat job berada dalam status **In progress** tidak sama dengan usage-nya. Baik [estimasi usage](/guides/estimate-job-run-time) maupun [waktu eksekusi maksimum](/guides/max-execution-time) hanya didasarkan pada waktu QPU terkunci untuk mengeksekusi jobmu, dan karena itu tidak termasuk pemrosesan klasik multi-threaded yang dijelaskan di atas. Waktu **In progress** yang lama tidak meningkatkan usage atau biaya yang dilaporkan.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Session mode is different {#session-mode-is-different}"
msgstr "Mode session itu berbeda {#session-mode-is-different}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The preceding behavior applies to [job mode](/guides/execution-modes#job-mode) and [batch mode](/guides/execution-modes#batch-mode). In [session mode](/guides/execution-modes#session-mode), during the session's active window, the user has exclusive access to the backend and no other jobs can run, including calibration jobs. Therefore, any QPU contention happens only among your own session jobs. In addition, because QPU capacity is reserved for the duration of the session, session usage is measured as the elapsed time while the session remains active, regardless of whether jobs are actively running. See [Workload usage](/guides/estimate-job-run-time#usage) for more information.\n"
msgstr "Perilaku sebelumnya berlaku untuk [mode job](/guides/execution-modes#job-mode) dan [mode batch](/guides/execution-modes#batch-mode). Dalam [mode session](/guides/execution-modes#session-mode), selama jendela aktif session, pengguna memiliki akses eksklusif ke backend dan tidak ada job lain yang bisa berjalan, termasuk job kalibrasi. Oleh karena itu, QPU contention apa pun hanya terjadi di antara job session milikmu sendiri. Selain itu, karena kapasitas QPU dicadangkan selama durasi session, usage session diukur sebagai waktu yang berlalu selama session tetap aktif, terlepas dari apakah job sedang aktif berjalan atau tidak. Lihat [Usage workload](/guides/estimate-job-run-time#usage) untuk informasi lebih lanjut.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "View remaining usage {#view-remaining-usage}"
msgstr "Lihat sisa penggunaan {#view-remaining-usage}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Track how much of your plan's usage quota remains.\n"
msgstr "Lacak berapa banyak sisa kuota usage dari planmu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit\" label=\"Check usage with Qiskit\">\n"
"        Use the `service.usage()` method to get usage information for your current active instance.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit\" label=\"Periksa usage dengan Qiskit\">\n"
"        Gunakan metode `service.usage()` untuk mendapatkan informasi usage untuk instance aktif kamu saat ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP\" label=\"View usage on IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        Navigate to the [Instances page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) and select the tab associated with the plan you want to check. The total time used and total time remaining on your plan is displayed.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP\" label=\"Lihat usage di IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        Navigasikan ke [halaman Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) dan pilih tab yang sesuai dengan paket yang ingin kamu periksa. Total waktu yang sudah digunakan dan total waktu yang tersisa pada paketmu akan ditampilkan.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "View job metrics {#view-job-metrics}"
msgstr "Lihat metrik job {#view-job-metrics}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get an overview of your job submissions, including batch and session workload metrics.\n"
msgstr "Dapatkan gambaran umum tentang pengiriman jobmu, termasuk metrik workload batch dan session.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit\" label=\"Get job metrics with Qiskit\">\n"
"        Use the [`service.jobs()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#jobs)  method with filters to retrieve information about your submitted jobs, such as how many have been submitted, what their statuses are, and when they were created. The following example retrieves all jobs submitted in the last seven days and calculates the total usage from those jobs.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit\" label=\"Dapatkan metrik job dengan Qiskit\">\n"
"        Gunakan metode [`service.jobs()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#jobs) dengan filter untuk mengambil informasi tentang job yang kamu kirimkan, seperti berapa banyak yang sudah dikirim, apa statusnya, dan kapan job dibuat. Contoh berikut mengambil semua job yang dikirim dalam tujuh hari terakhir dan menghitung total usage dari job-job tersebut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP\" label=\"View job metrics on IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        Navigate to the [Analytics page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/analytics) to see and download data, such as the following:\n"
"        - Total usage\n"
"        - Usage filtered by instance, quantum computer, and user\n"
"        - Count of job, batch, and session workloads\n"
msgstr ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP\" label=\"Lihat metrik job di IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        Navigasikan ke [halaman Analytics](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/analytics) untuk melihat dan mengunduh data, seperti berikut:\n"
"        - Total usage\n"
"        - Usage difilter berdasarkan instance, komputer kuantum, dan pengguna\n"
"        - Jumlah workload job, batch, dan session\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        **Note**: You can only access the Analytics page for accounts that you own or manage.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"        **Catatan**: Kamu hanya bisa mengakses halaman Analytics untuk akun yang kamu miliki atau kelola.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retrieve job results at a later time {#retrieve-job-results-at-a-later-time}"
msgstr "Ambil hasil job di lain waktu {#retrieve-job-results-at-a-later-time}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can save job IDs and retrieve results later, even after closing your session.\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa menyimpan ID job dan mengambil hasilnya nanti, bahkan setelah menutup sessionmu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit\" label=\"Retrieve results with Qiskit\">\n"
"        If you saved the job ID when you submitted the job, use `service.job(<job_id>)` to retrieve it later. If you don't have the job ID, or if you want to retrieve multiple jobs at once (including jobs from retired QPUs), use `service.jobs()` instead, with optional filters.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit\" label=\"Ambil hasil dengan Qiskit\">\n"
"        Jika kamu menyimpan ID job saat mengirimkan job, gunakan `service.job(<job_id>)` untuk mengambilnya nanti. Jika kamu tidak memiliki ID job, atau jika kamu ingin mengambil beberapa job sekaligus (termasuk job dari QPU yang sudah pensiun), gunakan `service.jobs()` sebagai gantinya, dengan filter opsional.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "        See the [`QiskitRuntimeService.jobs`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#jobs) API documentation for available filters.\n"
msgstr "        Lihat dokumentasi API [`QiskitRuntimeService.jobs`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#jobs) untuk filter yang tersedia.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "        This example demonstrates retrieving recent results run on a specific backend.\n"
msgstr "        Contoh ini mendemonstrasikan cara mengambil hasil terbaru yang dijalankan pada backend tertentu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP\" label=\"Retrieve results on IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        1. Go to the [Workloads page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads).\n"
"        2. Use the search or filter options to find your job by name, date, or status.\n"
"        3. Click on the job to view its results and details.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP\" label=\"Ambil hasil di IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        1. Buka [halaman Workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads).\n"
"        2. Gunakan opsi pencarian atau filter untuk menemukan jobmu berdasarkan nama, tanggal, atau status.\n"
"        3. Klik pada job untuk melihat hasil dan detailnya.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retrieve backend properties {#retrieve-backend-properties}"
msgstr "Ambil properti backend {#retrieve-backend-properties}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit\" label=\"Retrieve backend properties with Qiskit\">\n"
"        You can use `job.properties()` to retrieve backend properties, including error rates, at the time of the job execution.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit\" label=\"Ambil properti backend dengan Qiskit\">\n"
"        Kamu bisa menggunakan `job.properties()` untuk mengambil properti backend, termasuk error rate, pada saat eksekusi job.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "        This example demonstrates how to retrieve backend properties that were current at the time a job was executed, including $T_1$/$T_2$ times and error rates for a specific qubit (0).\n"
msgstr "        Contoh ini mendemonstrasikan cara mengambil properti backend yang berlaku pada saat job dijalankan, termasuk waktu $T_1$/$T_2$ dan error rate untuk qubit tertentu (0).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        <Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Deprecated provider packages\">\n"
"            `service.jobs()` also returns jobs run from the deprecated `qiskit-ibm-provider` package. Jobs submitted by the older (also deprecated) `qiskit-ibmq-provider` package are no longer available.\n"
"        </Admonition>\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP\" label=\"Retrieve backend properties on IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        You can see calibration data for the backend at the time of job execution, as well as at job creation.\n"
"        1. Go to the [Workloads page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads)\n"
"        2. Click a workload to open its Details page\n"
"        3. Under Quantum computer, click View calibration history\n"
"        4. Use the dropdown menu to change from viewing the data \"At job execution start\" to \"At job creation\"\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"        <Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Paket provider yang sudah usang\">\n"
"            `service.jobs()` juga mengembalikan job yang dijalankan dari paket `qiskit-ibm-provider` yang sudah usang. Job yang dikirim oleh paket `qiskit-ibmq-provider` yang lebih lama (juga sudah usang) tidak lagi tersedia.\n"
"        </Admonition>\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP\" label=\"Ambil properti backend di IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        Kamu bisa melihat data kalibrasi untuk backend pada saat eksekusi job, maupun pada saat pembuatan job.\n"
"        1. Buka [halaman Workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads)\n"
"        2. Klik sebuah workload untuk membuka halaman Details-nya\n"
"        3. Di bawah Quantum computer, klik View calibration history\n"
"        4. Gunakan menu dropdown untuk mengubah tampilan data dari \"At job execution start\" ke \"At job creation\"\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cancel a job {#cancel-a-job}"
msgstr "Batalkan job {#cancel-a-job}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cancel a job that is queued or running. Once a job is canceled, it cannot be resumed.\n"
msgstr "Batalkan job yang sedang antre atau berjalan. Setelah job dibatalkan, job tidak bisa dilanjutkan kembali.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit\" label=\"Cancel with Qiskit\">\n"
"        Use the `job.cancel()` method to cancel a job programmatically.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit\" label=\"Batalkan dengan Qiskit\">\n"
"        Gunakan metode `job.cancel()` untuk membatalkan job secara programatik.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP\" label=\"Cancel on IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        1. **From the workloads table**: Click the overflow menu at the end of the row for the workload you want to cancel, and select **Cancel**.\n"
"        2. **From the job details page**: Click on the workload to open its details page, use the **Actions** dropdown at the top, and select **Cancel**.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP\" label=\"Batalkan di IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        1. **Dari tabel workloads**: Klik menu overflow di akhir baris untuk workload yang ingin kamu batalkan, dan pilih **Cancel**.\n"
"        2. **Dari halaman detail job**: Klik pada workload untuk membuka halaman detailnya, gunakan dropdown **Actions** di bagian atas, dan pilih **Cancel**.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

